From: nabu port
Subject: [PATCH 0010] macOS 27 kernel interfaces and ABI fixes for the full startup closure

With the 69 roots of UniXNU's macos-27.3-26C5035r profile, strict emission
stopped on 11 references to kernel interfaces XNU 12377 lacks. This patch
takes, from UniXNU (BSD-2-Clause-Patent, see lab/compat/NOTICE.md), the parts
of patches/xnu-12377/darwin26-kpi.patch and
profiles/os/macos-27.3-26C5035r/patches/xnu-12377/macos-darwin26-kpi.patch
(revision d8210e0) that 0007-0009 do not already cover:
  - code signing: csblob_get_cdhash_with_length, proc_getcdhash_with_length,
    *_cdhash_ext and *_cdhash_with_length, query_trust_cache[_for_rem]_with_length
  - ABI: amfi_t TrustCache v5 layout, Darwin 26 trust cache query types,
    the sixth argument of mpo_vnode_check_lookup_preflight
  - ifnet_enable_synchronous_input, task_get_sanitizer_config,
    vnodeop_desc_name, os_log_coprocessor_with_handle, os_metric_coprocessor,
    DriverKit IOService::CallPlatformFunction (answers unsupported)
---
